WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Command palette and search. Press Ctrl K / ⌘K to create a task, find anything, or jump to any page.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: find a half-remembered task; capture mid-flow.

3
00:00:09.870 --> 00:00:11.920
Open the palette from Search, or press Ctrl K.

4
00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:14.510
Type to search tasks and workspaces…

5
00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:17.470
…and open a hit straight in the drawer.

6
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:26.930
It also creates tasks and jumps to pages.

7
00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.930
No results: Type at least two characters, and check you're in the workspace that holds the task.

8
00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:37.430
Search tasks and workspaces
